  "shots": [
    {
      "scene": "kael",
      "text": "He came at night, through a tunnel even I didn't know existed.",
      "pause": 0.5,
      "options": {
        "mode": "alive"
      }
    },
    {
      "scene": "kael",
      "text": "One broken antenna, a scar across his face, the same crooked smile from the nursery.",
      "pause": 0.5,
      "options": {
        "mode": "alive"
      }
    },
    {
      "scene": "hideout",
      "text": "\"Hey, 250.\"",
      "pause": 0.6,
      "memory": true,
      "options": {
        "mode": "visit"
      }
    },
    {
      "scene": "hideout",
      "text": "I could've called the guards. I didn't. We sat in the dark like we were kids again.",
      "pause": 0.6,
      "options": {
        "mode": "visit"
      }
    },
    {
      "scene": "hideout",
      "text": "He told me about the rebellion. Two hundred trap-jaws, hiding in an old beetle burrow, waiting.",
      "pause": 0.5,
      "options": {
        "mode": "rebels"
      }
    },
    {
      "scene": "hideout",
      "text": "\"Free our people,\" he said. \"Come home. This isn't you.\"",
      "pause": 0.6,
      "memory": true,
      "options": {
        "mode": "visit"
      }
    },
    {
      "scene": "closeup",
      "text": "For one second, I almost said yes. I almost took off the armor.",
      "pause": 0.5
    },
    {
      "scene": "theGreen",
      "text": "Then the green pulsed, hot, behind my eyes.",
      "pause": 0.3,
      "options": {
        "intensity": 0.9
      }
    },
    {
      "scene": "theGreen",
      "text": "[He'll take Tavi. He'll take everything.]",
      "pause": 0.6,
      "options": {
        "intensity": 0.9
      }
    },
    {
      "scene": "hideout",
      "text": "Kael stood up to leave and said, \"Tomorrow night. The cold tunnels. Be there, brother.\"",
      "pause": 0.6,
      "memory": true,
      "options": {
        "mode": "visit"
      }
    },
    {
      "scene": "dark",
      "text": "Then he was gone. And the voice kept repeating one word.",
